## ⚠ What this license does NOT cover

**This license applies to the source code of this repository only.**

1. **Baseball records and statistics.** The underlying records come from the
   Nippon Professional Baseball Organization (npb.jp). They are not ours to
   license. This repository does not contain them — the collected archive and
   the derived database are kept outside this repository.

2. **`packages/parser/test/fixtures/wiki-*.html.gz`** — these are pages from
   ja.wikipedia and are licensed under **CC BY-SA 4.0**, not MIT. Each file
   carries its own canonical URL and license link inside its bytes.
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

3. **Generated pages.** The published site presents values this project
   recalculated from public records. It does not reproduce the original
   tables. If you republish those values, cite npb.jp as the source of the
   records.

⚠ **Running this code makes network requests under your own identity.**
Set `BB_ARCHIVER_CONTACT` to a contact address that actually receives mail.
The collector is deliberately slow (1 request per 2–5 seconds, single
connection). Do not remove that limit.
